@baseUrl = http://localhost:5043

### Health check (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List admin products (requires admin JWT via cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products?page=1&pageSize=10

### List admin products with search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products?search=áo&status=active&page=1&pageSize=10

### Get single product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/1

### Create a new product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Áo dài test RBAC",
  "slug": "ao-dai-test-rbac",
  "productType": "ao-dai",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "shortDescription": "Sản phẩm test RBAC",
  "status": "draft",
  "isFeatured": false
}

### Update product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Áo dài test cập nhật",
  "slug": "ao-dai-test-rbac",
  "productType": "ao-dai",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "status": "active",
  "isFeatured": true
}

### Toggle product status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "inactive"
}

### Delete product (soft-delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/1
